      "writtenOn": "2015-09-04T18:33:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If avtab_search_node() on line 282 returns NULL, then we\u0027ll end up returning an error on line 311. Is this correct? I would have expected that the absence of any elements would result in success, not failure.",
      "revId": "73f981648e6d70f4bf9d78052af32893173ea110",
